<title>UK: Johnson Matthey active as stake placed.</title>
<headline>Johnson Matthey active as stake placed.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-07-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Johnson Matthey Plc shares were heavily traded on Friday as SBC Warburg placed a block of some 19 million shares at 560p, dealers said.</p>
<p>The shares were unchanged at 564-1/2 by 0900 GMT in volume of 37.5 million shares. It was the most active stock in the London market at that point.  </p>
<p>Dealers said the stake was likely to be the holding owned by Johannesburg Consolidated Investments but no-one at the company was immediately available for comment.</p>
<p>-- David Holmes, London Newsroom +44 171 542 4367</p>
</text>
